3,Telefol language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/Telefol_language,"The Telefol language is primarily spoken in the Telefomin District of Sandaun Province, Papua New Guinea, with the main concentration in a large central area surrounding the administrative center of Telefomin in the mountainous interior.",Telefol,Trans-New Guinea
